  <data name="Mods_ProtocolIntro" xml:space="preserve"><value>Mods send a JSON object as a UDP packet to 127.0.0.1 and the port on the left (or write it into the text file). Every field is optional – only what is sent changes:</value></data>
  <data name="Mods_ProtocolDetails" xml:space="preserve"><value>Trigger modes: off · resistance (start, strength) · section (start, end, strength) · weapon (start, end, strength) · vibration (start, strength, frequency). Positions 0–9, strength 1–8. micLed: off/on/pulse. &quot;reset&quot;: true hands control back to PadPilot. An empty object {} only asks for the status. Every packet is answered with JSON: controller, connection, battery, emulation. Full description: docs/MOD-PROTOKOLL.md</value></data>
